gxde-hisi-9000c-gpu-compat (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 新增 /usr/local/bin/gxde-movie 启动劫持：剥离 LD_PRELOAD /
    LD_LIBRARY_PATH 后调用原二进制，修复 gxde-movie 在 hisi 会话中
    打开视频崩溃的问题（mpv/Qt OpenGL 路径与 gbm shim 冲突）

 -- shenmo <jifengshenmo@outlook.com>  Mon, 10 Aug 2026 20:25:00 +0800

gxde-hisi-9000c-gpu-compat (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: hisi GPU (Maleoon 910) compatibility layer for GXDE
    on HiSilicon Kirin 9000c with the Kylin 5.10.97-38-9000c kernel.
    Includes the startgxde_wlcom_9000c hisi EGL/gbm session launcher,
    UOS libwayland 1.21, the LD_PRELOAD compat shim and the
    xwayland-mesa wrapper.

 -- shenmo <jifengshenmo@outlook.com>  Sat, 09 Aug 2026 18:30:00 +0800
